OROCHIMARU RESEARCH DIVISION
IMMORTALITY RESEARCH — MASTER ARCHIVE INDEX
CLEARANCE: LORD OROCHIMARU / HEAD MEDIC ONLY

Purpose
The pursuit of endless life is the founding purpose of this village and of all its work.
Every other program feeds this one. This index catalogs the archive's lines of study.

Lines of Study
I.   Living Corpse Reincarnation (body transfer). The active method. Grants continuation
     but demands a fresh host every three years and a term of assimilation. See the
     transfer schedule and the forbidden scroll.
II.  Host durability. Extend the usable term of a vessel and reduce degradation, lengthening
     the interval between transfers. Cross-referenced with the modification program.
III. Bloodline incorporation. Acquire and retain kekkei genkai across vessels so no ability
     is lost on transfer. See the DNA notes and collection log.
IV.  Reincarnation arts. Study of Impure World Reincarnation for what it reveals about
     binding a soul to a body. Not a path to true immortality by itself, but instructive.
V.   The mastery of all techniques. Lord Orochimaru's stated aim is to live long enough to
     learn every jutsu in the world. Immortality is the means; total mastery is the end.

Standing Note
This archive is the most sensitive holding in the village. No extract leaves Zone C. Its
existence is known only to those reading these words.
